'''Idle Merchant''' (掛機商人) is a PC-only idle [[:Category:Game worlds|game world]] created by {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_6d8387cb-dc71-4555-baf3-6ef662e91ca9|turbo-}}.<ref>[https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ebca0ab7-7ea8-46e2-aac6-fc5a67f94924 Idle Merchant] on ''vrchat.com''.</ref> Players open cases for random equipment, sell it on a simulated market, and hire a hero for idle combat.

== Layout ==

The world is a furnished interior with a bed, a visitor information board, and QvPen pens. A VizVid video player and switches for mirrors, audio, video, colliders, post-processing, and a night-mode slider sit on the walls.

The game UI is a large canvas with pages for cases, the item catalog, inventory, sell orders, a cashier counter, idle battle, fusion contracts, reforge, player-to-player transfers, settings, Q&A, and a Developer Page. A separate leaderboard canvas stands in the room. An in-world changelog lists version notes.

The Developer Page is a digit pad. 30919 is the tester code. It only works if the player's display name is on a tester list. 70486 unlocks a debug panel that can reset that player's saved data.

The interface language defaults to Traditional Chinese. Players can switch to Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, or English.

== Gameplay ==

Progress saves with [[Special:MyLanguage/Persistence|Persistence]]. A settings panel shows storage use and can reset saved progress. Starting money is 0. Inventory holds 200 items. Sell orders hold 50 listings.

A tutorial can run on first play and can be restarted from settings.

=== Cases ===

There are five cases. Each open gives one random item from that case. Ten free opens refresh each day. After that, an open costs money.

Auto-open can collect or stop when a gold item appears, collect or stop on red or gold, or send the item into a fusion contract.

Every item name always uses the same color. Crude Iron Sword is always blue. Mithril Sword is always red. An open first picks a color, then picks one item from that case in that color. The color odds are blue 70%, purple 25%, pink 4%, red 0.8%, and gold 0.2%.

