Gold items cannot be fused.

The new item comes from the cases the spent items came from. It is always the next color. The name has to appear in one of those cases. Spending more items from one case makes that case's names more likely. If that case only has a few names in the next color, each of those names is more likely. Attack, attack speed, and passives are rolled again. They are not copied from the spent items.

=== Reforge ===

Reforge spends money to reroll stats or passives. Later cases and rarer colors cost more. Exclusive rare passives cannot be reforged. Reforging an empty passive slot is a paid world-store unlock. An item that is not in any case uses the Beginner Forge Case prices.

