=== Idle battle ===

Players hire one hero class and can switch later. Auto expedition sends the hero through a region. Each kill spends one Harvest. Harvested kills drop extra money and EXP. Harvest count resets daily. A boss appears after a set number of fights. The next region unlocks after that region's boss.

Heroes equip a weapon, helmet or hat, armor or robe, and accessory. Appearance can be set separately from equipped stats. The class table lists the preferred weapon and armor types.

