=== Leaderboard ===

The board ranks players by the total current market value of items in the inventory. Money on hand is not counted. Cards can show a showcased weapon, player level, and a background pattern. Free patterns include stars, pentagons, Diagonal 1, scattered shapes, warning, wave, ocean wave, morphing ball, crystal, clouds, hearts, skulls, puzzle, chains, flags, and floral. Graffiti Pattern and Mysterious Letters Pattern unlock from the world store.

=== World store ===

The world is enrolled in the [[Special:MyLanguage/Creator Economy|Creator Economy]]. The world store sells these listings for [[Special:MyLanguage/Creator Economy#VRChat Credits|VRChat Credits]]:

* '''Reforge Empty Passives''' (新增空詞條), 299 credits, permanent. Unlocks reforging an empty passive slot.
* '''Tipper 1''' (贊助者 1), 100 credits, permanent. Unlocks Graffiti Pattern and Mysterious Letters Pattern on the leaderboard.
* '''Tip''' (贊助), 100 credits. Nothing.

