=== Passive pools ===

Ordinary and rare passives come from the lists below. An exclusive rare on an item in the table always fills one slot on that item.

==== Melee weapons ====

* Increases Attack by 3%
* Increases Attack Speed by 3%
* Attacks have a low chance to cause bleeding for 6 seconds
* Attacks have a low chance to cause poison for 6 seconds
* Attacks have a low chance to cause burning for 4 seconds
* Attacks have a low chance to cause freezing for 8 seconds
* Attacks have a low chance to cause lightning for 2 seconds
* Attacks have a high chance to trigger a fiery explosion. 20-second cooldown. (rare)
* Attacks have a high chance to launch ice spikes. 20-second cooldown. (rare)
* Attacks have a high chance to call down powerful lightning strikes. 20-second cooldown. (rare)
* Attacks have a high chance to release freezing air and freeze enemies. 20-second cooldown. (rare)
* Attacks have a high chance to summon thorns. 20-second cooldown. (rare)
* 5% chance to dodge damage when hit
* Attacks have a high chance to automatically attack a second time (rare)
* 30% chance to deal random bonus damage when attacking (rare)

